1
00:00:00,074 --> 00:00:02,034
...you might make this a viable business.

2
00:00:02,493 --> 00:00:03,953
(Penny:)And you know about that stuff?

3
00:00:04,119 --> 00:00:05,959
(Sheldon:)Penny.

4
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:10,796
(Sheldon:)I'm a physicist.

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:15,920
(Sheldon:)I have a working knowledge of the entire
universe and everything it contains.

6
00:00:18,259 --> 00:00:19,679
(Penny:)Who's Radiohead?

7
00:00:32,064 --> 00:00:36,404
(Sheldon:)I have a working knowledge
of the important things in the universe.

8
00:00:36,568 --> 00:00:39,238
(Sheldon:)- Good luck.
- Sheldon, hold on.

9
00:00:39,405 --> 00:00:42,995
(Penny:)Could you maybe show me
how to make more money with this?

10
00:00:43,742 --> 00:00:45,572
(Sheldon:)Of course I could.

11
00:00:45,744 --> 00:00:47,374
(Penny:)Sheldon, wait.

12
00:00:47,955 --> 00:00:49,245
(Penny:)Will you?

13
00:00:53,294 --> 00:00:55,334
(Sheldon:)Just to be clear here.

14
00:00:55,504 --> 00:00:57,424
(Sheldon:)You're asking for my assistance.

15
00:00:57,589 --> 00:00:58,669
(Penny:)Yes.

16
00:00:58,841 --> 00:01:02,761
(Sheldon:)And you understand that will involve me
telling you what to do?

17
00:01:03,846 --> 00:01:05,306
(Penny:)I understand.

18
00:01:05,472 --> 00:01:09,852
(Sheldon:)And you're not allowed to be sarcastic
or snide to me while I'm doing so.

19
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,190
(Penny:)Okay.

20
00:01:13,772 --> 00:01:15,232
(Sheldon:)Good.

21
00:01:15,983 --> 00:01:20,943
(Sheldon:)Let's begin with the premise that everything
you've done up to this point is wrong.

22
00:01:21,822 --> 00:01:24,452
- Oh, imagine that.
- Sarcasm. Goodbye.

23
00:01:24,616 --> 00:01:27,036
No, I'm sorry. Wait. Please, come back.

